\subsubsection parameters ROS parameters

Reads and maintains the following parameters on the ROS server

- \b "~filter_field_name" : \b [str] The field name used for filtering min: , default: range, max: 
- \b "~filter_limit_min" : \b [double] The minimum allowed field value a point will be conside	red from min: -100000.0, default: 0.0, max: 100000.0
- \b "~filter_limit_max" : \b [double] The maximum allowed field value a point will be considered from min: -100000.0, default: 200.0, max: 100000.0
- \b "~filter_limit_negative" : \b [bool] Set to true if we want to return the data outside [filter_limit_min; filter_limit_max]. min: False, default: False, max: True

